lines=['# POINT speed and the two PTC alternatives — 2026-09-27','', '**Keep the current rank-10 method as the reference.** The measured T10 exit median was **123.75s** (119.45–129.21), versus **145.80s** (140.16–152.66) for warm ALS and **163.63s** (160.96–173.36) for covariance. The shortest directly measured near-T10 checkpoint was current rank10 **N=5:84.46s to exit** (one run;77.83s median prefix readiness). This is useful evidence for a future stopping study, not an automatic stopping rule.','', '**Timing limitation:** the unchanged driver scans the entire growing campaign directory twice around every native call to enforce storage bounds. Measured time outside native subprocess invocations grew strongly with run order. These are actual raw-to-result timings under the declared unchanged policy, but they cannot establish the intrinsic speed ordering of PCA methods. We do not subtract overhead and present the result as measured end-to-end speed. Phase C is deliberately unselected; no scientific retry or replacement was used.','', '26 trajectories,198 feedback applications,20 original-input parents and26 endpoint companions completed. Phase A strict rank10/rank15 regressions and every shortened prefix passed. Phase B completed all12 cells; support was preserved throughout. Scope is POINT152430/0/2,a2000,networks11/12 only, on Apple M4 Pro14cores/48GiB, local AppleClang/Homebrew Release. This is supplemental local evidence, not Unity/Spack or full-instrument timing.','', '## Actual latency and acquisition duration','',f'Bound native time axes span {duration:.5f}s (network11;network12=64.05325s). Ratios below divide by the larger first-to-last span; including the final0.008192s sample changes ratios negligibly. Sample integration is not acquisition duration. Fresh process/original-input numerical state for every repetition; OS caches were not flushed, input verification may warm them, and the first use was retained. Network workers2,feedback segment workers1,numerical threads1,independent workloads1. No competing campaign builds/reports ran during timing.','', '| Method/rank | T10 ready median [range], s | Analysis median, s | Exit median [range], s | Exit/acquisition | CPU median, s | Peak aggregate RSS, GiB |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
