lines+=['', 'PTC fit includes initialization and decomposition; these columns are nested, never additive. Native adapter residual is native wall minus sequential segment walls, MAP and final serialization/verification. It is not automatically RTC or I/O. Outside-native time is the instrumented call span minus measured subprocess-invocation walls; it includes storage accounting and bookkeeping. The two recursive storage scans per call and growing file population explain a strong run-order confound, but no separate scan timer was installed, so the causal attribution is explicitly an inference supported by code and timing, not isolated measurement.','', 'Warm ALS reduces the first-run ten-cycle fitting cost8.75→0.60s and J sum3037→354, with2.76s predecessor authentication/loading. Covariance takes4.87s to learn and hasJ=0 by construction. Warm initialization therefore has a genuine measured native-kernel benefit; the full invocation does not demonstrate a net improvement under this campaign driver. Native adapter residual alone is46–49s across ten cycles. The unchanged conditional endpoint costs0.04–0.06s in first representatives; uncertainty analysis is not the bottleneck. Per-network RTC/CAL traces overlap and cannot be summed as critical-path wall. Full stage/initialization/projection/loading/subtraction/MAP/serialization/verification and CPU/startup records are retained.','', 'PCA decomposition was only3.1s of the reference ten-cycle native feedback wall. This does not justify a third randomized/truncated solver now. The next optimization target should be accounting/provenance and the unattributed native adapter work, with scientific identity/support preserved.','', '## Source evolution and practical stability','', 'All measurements use common physical aperture/template geometry and each method/rank’s own noise. Brightness is mJy per nominal beam; centroids and FWHM are arcsec; aperture2 is mJy per nominal beam arcsec². Fitted constant subtraction remains part of template/aperture values.','', '| Family | N | Peak | East / North | Major / Minor FWHM | Template | Aperture2 |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
